# Zooming out with , returns to the parent and focuses the block the user was zoomed into.
file <<END
Trip to Japan:
	- Book flights
	Hotels:
		- Kyoto ryokan
Groceries:
	- Milk
END
keys j j . ,
see - Book flights
hide › Hotels
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Trip to Japan:
	- Book flights
	Hotels: @done({today})
		- Kyoto ryokan
Groceries:
	- Milk
END
